According to Section 7.1 STANDARD TEST FILE STRUCTURE of the HPX QE QAMA Scripting Best Practice Knowledge Base, test classes MUST inherit from 'object', not 'unittest.TestCase'. The correct pattern is:

class Test_Suite_XX_<FeatureName>(object):

CORRECTION REQUIRED:
Change the class declaration from:
  class Test_Suite_01_Add_Shortcut(unittest.TestCase):
To:
  class Test_Suite_01_Add_Shortcut(object):

Additionally, remove the 'import unittest' statement as it is not needed in the HPX automation framework. The framework uses pytest for test organization, not unittest.
